      "en": "For whatever is born of God overcomes the world. This is the victory that has overcome the world: your faith.",
      "ko": "대저 하나님께로서 난 자마다 세상을 이기느니라 세상을 이긴 이김은 이것이니 우리의 믿음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "72355d26a89c3da86e670e199cbdbc720fb114f45192fee9d35d721e8fcbb2b3",
      "translation_text_hash": "b40b1163a0ae6a7546684bb6478ce2a98b51a9a83a81a25f222534c81f84f917",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
